WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.890
It’s project time! Make two pets talk in ScratchJr, taking turns with waits, and add a looks surprise.

2
00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:10.560
Choose two pets.

3
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.940
Give them names.

4
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.050
What will they talk about?

5
00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.990
Each pet says at least two things.

6
00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.450
Use waits so they take turns.

7
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:23.390
Add a grow, shrink, hide or show for a funny surprise.

8
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:27.750
Press the green flag and show your scene to a friend.

9
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.840
The puppy says “Watch this!”, grows, says “I’m big!”, then walks to the star.

10
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.750
Ta-da! A big puppy with big news.

11
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:39.420
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

12
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:43.540
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
